OL,3,GNEWSAHousing estate could be built in
OL,4,A'beautiful' valley
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 200 homes could be built in a
OL,7,F"beautiful" valley as part of a major
OL,8,Fdevelopment that includes a new tram
OL,9,Fstop.
OL,11,FBarratt Homes Manchester have asked
OL,12,FOldham Council to approve up to 192
OL,13,Fhomes at Birshaw Farm in the Beal
OL,14,FValley, Oldham, Greater Manchester.
OL,16,FIt forms part of wider plans for the
OL,17,Farea, which includes around 2,000
OL,18,Fhomes, as well as other infrastructure.
OL,19,FThere is also a new road planned from
OL,20,FRipponden Road to Oldham Road, as well
OL,21,Fas a new Metrolink stop at Broadbent
OL,22,FMoss.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
