OL,3,GNEWSAHousing estate could be built in
OL,4,A'beautiful' valley
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scheme is part of the Greater
OL,7,FManchester Places for Everyone scheme,
OL,8,Fwhich aims to oversee house building,
OL,9,Fcreate jobs, and protect the regions's
OL,10,Fgreen belt land from unplanned
OL,11,Fdevelopment.
